WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
A person holds a new smartphone box beside a laptop.

00:05.000 --> 00:14.000
They lift away the lid, set it on the table, and take the phone from its tray.

00:14.000 --> 00:22.000
They hold the phone, look closely, and begin exploring it.

00:22.000 --> 00:30.500
The new owner turns the phone in their hands and touches its screen.
